P1 bugs:
- Overview scroll fixed + verified (view scrolls independently, body never moves);
  stats moved on top, Needs-Attention below, 3 overlapping widgets deduped into
  two legible type/priority distribution bars.
- Work Board filters rebuilt: multi-select Sets (OR within a facet, AND across),
  visible selected state (.btn.on — was missing), never-empty-on-valid-combo,
  clear button. Type chips relabelled to real kernel types (task/bug/feature/
  epic/decision/chore), no more feat/dec abbreviations.
- Dark mode is the default (versioned theme key so stale 'light' prefs don't
  override); toggle verified dark->light->dark.

P2 reorders:
- Columns Backlog -> Ready -> In progress -> Done -> Cancelled; Done/Cancelled
  behind a show/hide toggle (no separate archive view). Backlog = open+unclaimed+
  blocked (parked until unblocked), keeping blocked work visible.
- Epics first in the level toggle; epic cards open detail (filter is a sub-button);
  focus-epic re-renders when already on the board (same-hash no-op bug fixed).
- Phase honesty: done=shipped; claimed-open=in progress with remaining cells drawn
  dashed=unknown instead of asserting "dev" (SEAM a2279f65).

P3 new capabilities:
- In-render Markdown reader (166c27a9): work-folder .md baked into docs.js
  (window.FORGE_DOCS, capped per file) + a safe escape-first renderer; open from
  Plans/Memory in the detail overlay with a tab per file.
- Rich task/epic detail structure (56461780): Linked-work rows (files/PR/commits/
  activity) rendered as SEAM structure to fill as the graph lands.
- Graphical Decisions board (2a2ee501): status columns + source-tagged cards +
  detail + architecture index, replacing the flat list; relationship edges = SEAM.

P4 polish:
- Workspaces simplified: "working on" (PR/branch) line, fewer elements, Active/Merged.
- Memory: work-folder card grid (clickable to reader) + recall SEAM + Graphiti SEAM.
- Live Ops simplified + softened; worktree-by-surface removed (lives in Workspaces).

Tests: filter (multi-select) + markdown-render coverage added; 12 pass. Interaction-
verified in-browser (scroll, every filter, theme, reader, detail) at dark-default.

Refs dc81d48d (v5), 166c27a9, 2a2ee501, 56461780, a2279f65. Builds on 6513e098 + 7ed849b4.

